## Frontend Quality Checklist

- Test layouts at mobile, tablet, and desktop widths.
- Check for horizontal overflow on small screens.
- Use semantic HTML and accessible navigation.
- Verify keyboard accessibility for interactive elements.
- Describe any unresolved bugs honestly.
- Never report a test as passed unless it was executed.